  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Effective Justice Frameworks</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project supports member countries through the provision of judges to help in the reduction of case backlogs; capacity building to judges, magistrates, and prosecutors; development of model laws on a broad range of legal matters. The project will also build consensus, raise awareness and develop knowledge products to strengthen civil and criminal justice systems.</narrative>
  </description>
